### Ensure applicant wallet session exists (needs wallet signature challenge in live UI)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/session/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sRoleApplyTest1111111111111111111111111",
  "displayName": "Role Applicant",
  "role": "musician"
}

### Apply for venue role (pending) — Bearer = applicant JWT
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sRoleApplyTest1111111111111111111111111",
  "role": "venue"
}

### List pending applications (owner queue)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-applications?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Approve without Bearer → 401
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-applications/{{appId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "no token"
}

### Spoof body owner wallet with non-reviewer JWT → 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-applications/{{appId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{spoofToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewedByWallet": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "reason": "spoof"
}

### Approve with real principal JWT → 2xx (body wallet ignored for authz; audit = session wallet)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-applications/{{appId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewedByWallet": "SpoofIgnoredWallet",
  "reason": "Smoke approve venue"
}

### List memberships for applicant
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/roles/memberships?walletPubkey=Eh8sRoleApplyTest1111111111111111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Reject with principal JWT (fresh instructor application first)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-applications
Authorization: Bearer {{applicantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sRoleApplyTest1111111111111111111111111",
  "role": "instructor"
}

### Reject instructor → 2xx
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-applications/{{rejectAppId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Smoke reject instructor"
}

### Grant partner still works (principal JWT)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/role-grants
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "Eh8sRoleApplyTest1111111111111111111111111",
  "role": "partner"
}
